{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Unlock a container to allow removal and upgrades {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter ulck   [options] [container]{R}               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter unlock [options] [container]{R}               {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter ulck my-box{R}                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter ulck my-box --root{R}                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter unlock my-box{R}                              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter unlock my-box --root{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Unlock all otter containers{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--name{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-n{R}  {5}Name of the container to unlock{R}   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Unlock a rootful container{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--verbose{R} {2}┆{R} {4}-v{R}  {5}Show more verbose output{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--dry-run{R} {2}┆{R} {4}-d{R}  {5}Print without running{R}             {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Container must be running to unlock.{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Use 'otter start' to start it first.{R}              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {5}Already unlocked containers are skipped.{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
